{#
    The list order switch, beside the pagination. Used by the search results and
    by every folder list; they differ only in which orders they offer and which
    route the entries point at.

    Links rather than a <form> or a Stimulus write: each entry is a GET into the
    same route inside #inbox-list-frame — Turbo swaps the list and the URL, and
    the controller remembers the choice as a side effect of answering. Nothing
    here needs JavaScript beyond opening the menu.

    Page is dropped, never carried: page 4 of one order is not page 4 of another,
    and landing on it after switching shows a slice with no relation to what was
    on screen. Every switch starts at the top.

    Parameters:
      current  the option in force — any enum with .value and .transKey
      options  every option to offer, same enum
      route    the route each entry links to
#}
{# Route parameters as well as the query string: a label list lives at
   /mail/label/{id}, and rebuilding its URL from the query alone would drop the
   label and send every entry to a routing error. #}
{% set base_params = app.request.attributes.get('_route_params')|default({})
    |merge(app.request.query.all)
    |merge({page: null})
    |filter(v => v is not null) %}

{# data-search-sort-menu is the stable hook for "this control, here" — the
   toolbar holds other ui--dropdown menus and none of them are this one. The
   name predates the folder lists reusing it and is kept because the e2e specs
   and the search sort test both select on it. #}
<div class="relative shrink-0" data-search-sort-menu data-controller="ui--dropdown">
    <button type="button"
            data-action="click->ui--dropdown#toggle"
            aria-haspopup="true"
            title="{{ 'search.sort.label'|trans }}"
            class="flex items-center gap-1 h-7 px-2 rounded-full
                   text-xs text-ink-muted
                   hover:text-ink hover:bg-hover
                   transition-colors duration-100 cursor-pointer">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down-short-wide text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span class="whitespace-nowrap">{{ current.transKey|trans }}</span>
        <svg class="w-2.5 h-2.5" viewBox="0 0 10 10" fill="none"
             stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"
             stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="2,3.5 5,6.5 8,3.5"/>
        </svg>
    </button>

    <div data-ui--dropdown-target="menu" hidden
         role="menu"
         aria-label="{{ 'search.sort.label'|trans }}"
         class="absolute top-full mt-1 right-0 z-30 min-w-44 popover py-1">

        {% for option in options %}
            <a href="{{ path(route, base_params|merge({sort: option.value})) }}"
               data-turbo-frame="inbox-list-frame"
               data-turbo-action="advance"
               data-action="click->ui--dropdown#close"
               data-search-sort="{{ option.value }}"
               role="menuitem"
               aria-current="{{ option is same as(current) ? 'true' : 'false' }}"
               class="w-full flex items-center gap-2.5 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-left
                      hover:bg-hover hover:text-ink transition-colors
                      {{ option is same as(current) ? 'text-accent' : 'text-ink-muted' }}">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check w-3 text-center text-[11px] {{ option is same as(current) ? '' : 'invisible' }}"
                   aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span>{{ option.transKey|trans }}</span>
            </a>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</div>
